---
import Layout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro'
---

<Layout title="HabitTrack — Construye constancia" description="Organiza tus hábitos diarios, registra tu progreso y construye constancia con HabitTrack.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1600px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:w-[92%] lg:px-0">
    <section class="grid items-end gap-10 border-b border-[var(--color-border)] py-14 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_24rem] lg:gap-16" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div>
        <p class="text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">HÁBITOS DIARIOS / CONSTANCIA</p>
        <h1 class="mt-7 text-[clamp(5rem,16vw,13rem)] font-black leading-[0.72] tracking-[-0.09em]" id="hero-title">HABIT<br /><span class="text-[var(--color-accent)]">TRACK.</span></h1>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-xs border-l border-black/25 pl-5">
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/65">HabitTrack te ayuda a construir constancia siguiendo tus hábitos diarios de forma simple.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <a class="bg-black px-4 py-3 text-center text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[var(--color-accent)]" href="/register">EMPEZAR AHORA</a>
          <a class="border border-black/25 px-4 py-3 text-center text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-black transition-colors hover:border-black hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[var(--color-accent)]" href="/login">INICIAR SESIÓN</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="border-b border-black/15 py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="how-title">
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,2.2fr)] lg:gap-16">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">CÓMO FUNCIONA</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl" id="how-title">Tres pasos.<br />Nada más.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-px border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-black/20 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6 sm:p-7">
            <p class="text-[0.6rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-black/50">01</p>
            <h3 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-black tracking-[-0.06em]">CREA</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/60">Define los hábitos que quieres seguir cada día.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6 sm:p-7">
            <p class="text-[0.6rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-black/50">02</p>
            <h3 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-black tracking-[-0.06em]">MARCA</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/60">Registra cada hábito completado al terminar tu día.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6 sm:p-7">
            <p class="text-[0.6rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-black/50">03</p>
            <h3 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-black tracking-[-0.06em]">MANTÉN CONSTANCIA</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/60">Observa tu racha y tu progreso semana a semana.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="border-b border-black/15 py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="example-title">
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,2.2fr)] lg:gap-16">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-accent)]">EJEMPLO</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl" id="example-title">Así se ve<br />un día real.</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/60">Tres hábitos, dos completados. Progreso de hoy: 67%.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-black p-6 text-white sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:p-7">
            <p class="text-[0.6rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-white/60">HOY / 2 DE 3</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.07em] sm:mt-0">67%</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-px border border-t-0 border-[var(--color-border)] bg-black/20 md:grid-cols-3">
            <article class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[0.6rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em]">
                <span class="text-black/50">DIARIO</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[var(--color-accent)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]"></span>COMPLETADO</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[#3478f6]"></span>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.06em]">HIDRATACIÓN</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/60">Tomar 2 litros de agua.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[0.6rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em]">
                <span class="text-black/50">LUN — VIE</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[var(--color-accent)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]"></span>COMPLETADO</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]"></span>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.06em]">ESTUDIO</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/60">Estudiar desarrollo web 45 minutos.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[0.6rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em]">
                <span class="text-black/50">5 DÍAS</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-black/45"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#2f9d62]"></span>PENDIENTE</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 rounded-full bg-[#2f9d62]"></span>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.06em]">EJERCICIO</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/60">Entrenamiento en el gimnasio.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="grid gap-8 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.4fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-16" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.06em] sm:text-6xl" id="cta-title">La constancia<br />se <span class="text-[var(--color-accent)]">construye.</span></h2>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-end">
        <p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/60">Empieza con tu primer hábito hoy y sigue tu progreso día a día.</p>
        <a class="mt-6 bg-black px-4 py-3 text-center text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[var(--color-accent)] sm:w-auto sm:self-start sm:px-10" href="/register">EMPEZAR AHORA</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <footer class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-black/15 py-7 text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-black/50 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <span>HABITTRACK / 2026</span>
      <span>HÁBITOS / CONSTANCIA / PROGRESO</span>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
